  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu Trade, Investment and Private Sector Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu Trade, Investment, and Private Sector Program is being designed to unlock economic growth opportunities for Vanuatu and to strengthen bilateral economic partnership.  By consolidating efforts through a cohesive strategy, the investment will address existing inefficiencies, and enhance capabilities for trade, investment and private sector development.  The investment will aim to create new opportunities for economic growth and international collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
